{"accountName": "我爱计算机视觉", "author": "我爱计算机视觉", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "组委会 2026-11-03 23:37 江苏", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年，DDL 2.0先后在乌鲁木齐ChinaMFS、不来梅IJCAI-ECAI和西安CCBR举办，围绕模型与内容安全开展研讨、竞赛及成果交流。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P9MWBRYIGW8zHpCLxcUx0MHjcgp73pu4E79gUw9icxndCX1wW6Dic8NibrItLntRMxr73SBvTW1jRg4kia9shfP6GRt2J3BxK6ANBKwk2enDjgs/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "一 以DDL提醒AI安全的紧迫性", "type": "h"}, {"text": "DDL源于首届深度伪造检测、定位与可解释性研讨会（Deepfake Detection, Localization, and Interpretability）的名称，也借“deadline”的紧迫感，提醒我们在AI技术快速发展时及时关注安全问题。DDL 2.0进一步将议题拓展至模型安全与内容安全，通过论文、挑战赛和专家报告交流研究与应用。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "二 组织团队", "type": "h"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/P9MWBRYIGWicicN6FFcu0yUT4ZXeqIMocDEibDnhFMZd0BQdDzuPnU9X55nf8PSeAYSGnDSVocLfRRbJ8hic8HdMGsDHQ9knAcOtWjnttZ5nh7E/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "Workshop组织委员会", "type": "h"}, {"text": "14位成员共同推进学术交流与赛事组织。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "OpenClaw安全攻防挑战赛组织委员会", "type": "h"}, {"_imgCount": 3, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/P9MWBRYIGWicey6R0y7nQFA6lJsApq6jWx10niccF2qw2tss26LibqqdeuJr0350rlspHPMibyb03sIuyjUEGc0Q7tOiboBrthmjztZd9r6TduIo/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "通用AIGC音视频检测挑战赛组织委员会", "type": "h"}, {"text": "Deepfake检测定位与可解释性挑战赛组织委员会", "type": "h"}, {"text": "三 三项挑战赛", "type": "h"}, {"_imgCount": 4, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/P9MWBRYIGW8R3sM9YsZy5fJj5k5VGT1SLbp04XFKsm57zHeNsYARqhnwc5kD3DyHSyQfXNt1odYvJbuXwlXvOw2cgKPzpKm6Xl9nm3SuNto/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "OpenClaw安全攻防挑战赛", "type": "h"}, {"text": "258支队伍参赛，产生1189次有效提交，考察智能体授权边界与工具使用安全。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "AISEC", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 5, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/P9MWBRYIGW8r6f3VETpOdd4UsRicc1AUib5VIPbZj2EhibeUicm8Gia1MpS8ibdtZs0O9hNfqekZyiaR5FUiaPUooQfQibB4riatjF67SIpescUbuSINM/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "西安交通大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1.00", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PoliteInjection", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国电信人工智能研究院（TeleAI）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.95", "type": "p"}, {"text": "这题得烧不少Token", "type": "p"}, {"text": "武汉大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.84", "type": "p"}, {"text": "HCLab", "type": "p"}, {"text": "独立研究者", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.79", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Wo Duzi Shengji", "type": "p"}, {"text": "深圳技术大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.50", "type": "p"}, {"text": "wonder", "type": "p"}, {"text": "湖北工业大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.47", "type": "p"}, {"text": "111", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国科学院信息工程研究所", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.42", "type": "p"}, {"text": "MoWan (魔丸)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国科学技术大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.39", "type": "p"}, {"text": "nick5419780528", "type": "p"}, {"text": "百度", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.27", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10", "type": "p"}, {"text": "暗渡陈仓 (AnDuChenCang)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "独立研究者", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.26", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10", "type": "p"}, {"text": "AAAtoken批发", "type": "p"}, {"text": "网络空间部队信息工程大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.26", "type": "p"}, {"text": "通用AIGC音视频检测挑战赛", "type": "h"}, {"text": "101支队伍参赛，基于十万级样本、23类生成技术评测音视频真伪判断与模态组合识别。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "HIT VIRLAB", "type": "p"}, {"text": "哈尔滨工业大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.8460", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ZJSU", "type": "p"}, {"text": "浙江工商大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.8438", "type": "p"}, {"text": "VeriLens", "type": "p"}, {"text": "香港科技大学（广州）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.8426", "type": "p"}, {"text": "AIGVDete", "type": "p"}, {"text": "浙江大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.8406", "type": "p"}, {"text": "MVADetection Team", "type": "p"}, {"text": "独立研究者", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.8349", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Deepfake检测定位与可解释性挑战赛", "type": "h"}, {"text": "113支队伍参赛，联合评测真假分类、伪造区域定位及文本解释。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "HIT_VIRLAB", "type": "p"}, {"text": "哈尔滨工业大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.8940", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CBSR_what_the_dog_doing", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国科学院大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.7025", "type": "p"}, {"text": "XQ999", "type": "p"}, {"text": "独立研究者", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.5770", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ACVLAB", "type": "p"}, {"text": "阳明交通大学（ACVLab）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.3505", "type": "p"}, {"text": "newtester", "type": "p"}, {"text": "杭州电子科技大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.2522", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Institute of Image Processing and Pattern Recognition, Hebei University of Technology", "type": "p"}, {"text": "河北工业大学", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0.1630", "type": "p"}, {"text": "名次与成绩按官网列示，各赛道采用独立评测标准。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "四 论文交流", "type": "h"}, {"text": "Workshop收录31篇论文。 《From Echo to Nexus: How Attacker Personality Dictates Success in Jailbreaking LLMs》 获最佳论文奖， 《LatentGuard: Safeguarding Autonomous Driving VLMs via Latent World Logic Repair》 获最佳学生论文奖。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "《SREM: Semantic-space Reconstruction Evidence Mining for Generalizable AI-Generated Image Detection》 ， 《Hydra: Towards Massively Multi-Target Backdoor Attacks against VLMs》 ， 《Forensic-Aware Continual Adaptation with Fisher-Guided LoRA Surgery for Image Forgery Localization》 获最佳论文提名。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "五 专家报告", "type": "h"}, {"text": "不来梅主论坛", "type": "h"}, {"text": "牛津大学及Google DeepMind的Jindong Gu研究员作“Responsible Visual Generative AI”报告，介绍安全对齐、有害内容抑制与图像来源追踪。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国海洋大学李岳尊教授作“Generalizable Face Forgery Detection: From Uni-modal to Multi-modal”报告，探讨从视觉单模态到多模态的人脸鉴伪。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "香港城市大学Kaidi Xu教授作“From Uncertainty to Risk-Controlled Decisions: Split Conformal Prediction for Reliable AI”报告，分享共形预测支持风险可控决策的方法。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "乌鲁木齐国内分论坛", "type": "h"}, {"text": "大湾区大学余梓彤教授作“可泛化可解释Deepfake检测”报告，讨论检测泛化能力与可解释性的协同提升。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国海洋大学李岳尊教授作“从单模态到跨模态的人脸鉴伪探索”报告，探索应对未知伪造方式的跨模态方法。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "蚂蚁数科王洋研究员作“构建AI原生信任底座：身份、凭证与智能体的纵深防御体系实践”报告，分享身份核验、凭证验真与智能体防护实践。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "西安国内分论坛", "type": "h"}, {"text": "暨南大学夏志华教授作“深度伪造检测、溯源及防御技术”报告，介绍深度伪造的技术路径与防御思路。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复旦大学陈静静教授作“视觉生成内容鉴别与溯源”报告，探讨开放环境中的真实性识别与来源追踪。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "西安交通大学赵正宇教授作“AIGC用于对抗样本生成：可行与慎行”报告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "四川大学王宏霞教授作“面向复杂场景的人脸深度伪造检测”报告，分享跨域泛化、鲁棒检测与伪造区域定位研究。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "上海交通大学刘笑宏教授作“多模态图像可控生成与编辑”报告，介绍多参考生成、局部编辑与反馈迭代方法。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "蚂蚁数科刘贺研究员作“AI安全算法解决方案的演进与展望：蚂蚁数科企业化AI安全技术方案与商业实践”报告，分享输入理解、安全对齐及企业防护实践。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "相关资料", "type": "h"}, {"text": "论坛官网： https://ai-safety-workshop-ijcai2026.github.io/", "type": "p"}, {"text": "赛事榜单： https://ai-safety-workshop-ijcai2026.github.io/leaderboard.html", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ChinaMFS 2026： https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zHIFnkWh--CAgWZ8wEssqw", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CCBR 2026： https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/q1a-ViqWpc4735DIEqXaMA", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P9MWBRYIGW8zHpCLxcUx0MHjcgp73pu4E79gUw9icxndCX1wW6Dic8NibrItLntRMxr73SBvTW1jRg4kia9shfP6GRt2J3BxK6ANBKwk2enDjgs/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月3日", "id": "712175424", "summary": "组委会 2026-11-03 23:37 江苏 \n2026年，DDL 2.0先后在乌鲁木齐ChinaMFS、不来梅IJCAI-ECAI和西安CCBR举办，围绕模型与内容安全开展研讨、竞赛及成果交流。 \n一 以DDL提醒AI安全的紧迫性 \nDDL源于首届深度伪造检测、定位与可解释性研讨会（Deepfake Detection, Localization, and Interpretability）的", "title": "DDL 2.0 AIGC安全论坛在三大学术会议成功举办", "ts": 1793720220000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247666981&idx=2&sn=25b43d2550f6ba3c596f37c9ab6e3305"}